      "created_at": "2013-01-27T00:41:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not entirely sure, If he is destroyed, but there are still devices in play, I would assume yes because his rules state to remove his character card, but doesn't say anything about playing his deck. Since the game is still going on you would still play a card, you just wouldn't recycle cards from the trash or play an additional card anymore. That's how I interpret the rules anyway.</p>",
